Follow the Plan → Act → Validate → Refine loop in the project root build instructions (uploaded / BUILD_LOG.md).

Critical rules:
- Ask (or log an explicit assumption with default) before deciding auth, data handling, LLM cost, content sources, coach rubric, branding deviations, or scale.
- All Azure OpenAI calls go through `apps/web/src/lib/azureOpenAI.ts`.
- Prompts live in `apps/web/src/lib/prompts/` — never inline in route handlers.
- Write tests before/alongside each unit; do not batch unvalidated features.
- Keep `BUILD_LOG.md` current for every loop.
- Use UST brand tokens; light theme; Source Sans 3 + Source Serif 4 substitutes.
